{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18084","headline":"赠别元十八协律六首 二 · 韩愈","name":"赠别元十八协律六首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"英英桂林伯，实惟文武特。\n远劳从事贤，来吊逐臣色。\n南裔多山海，道里屡纡直。\n风波无程期，所忧动不测。\n子行诚艰难，我去未穷极。\n临别且何言，有泪不可拭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}